Next, implement it. R5: if size > slotSize → throw a RangeError whose message includes that id. "The first one in placement order (R2), and no others." So, iterate in placement order and throw immediately when finding the first oversize item. That is, we don't need to collect all of them. Just scan in placement order, throw on the first oversize item. Note that "no others" means the message must not name other items. The simplest is: iterate in placement order, and as soon as we find an item with size > slotSize, throw immediately.

